7085:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32l4xx_ll_adc.h ****   /* Note: Write register with some additional bits forced to state reset     */
7086:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32l4xx_ll_adc.h ****   /*       instead of modifying only the selected bit for this function,      */
